>> title: Thick Toast
>> category: Flatbreads & Pancakes
>> tags: bread, butter, condensed milk, hong kong, toast
>> counters: Cha Chaan Teng
>> aka: thick toast, 厚多士, hau do si, 奶油多, naai yau do, 奶醬多, condensed milk toast, butter and condensed milk toast, thick cut butter toast, hong kong thick toast
>> pairs-with: white-sandwich-bread
>> servings: 1
>> time: 10 min
>> step.1: grill 3 min, gold outside, soft in
>> step.2: butter on while it is hot
>> step.3: condensed milk over, cut in two

Toast @thick-cut white bread{1%slice}(1 in thick, off an uncut loaf) under a hot #grill{} ~toast{3%min}, turning once.

Lay @salted butter{1%Tbs}(cold, in a slab) on @&(~1)hot toast{} and leave it to go most of the way in.

Pour @sweetened condensed milk{1%Tbs}(20 mL) over @&(~1)buttered toast{} in lines and cut it in two.

Peanut butter in place of the butter is 奶醬多 — a board prints each spread as its own row.
